// BASIC profile: per-call detail - when, who, how long, how big. Last 24h.
//
// All of it comes from the gateway log, so NO policy change is needed:
//     TimeGenerated       when the call happened
//     ApimSubscriptionId  which developer key made it
//     TotalTime           end to end at the gateway, ms
//     BackendTime         time waiting on Foundry, ms
//     RequestSize         request payload, bytes
//     ResponseSize        response payload, bytes
//
// TotalTime - BackendTime is the APIM overhead. That is the number to quote when
// someone says the gateway is slow: it is usually single-digit ms, and anything
// large is the model rather than APIM.
//
// This reads the APIM RESOURCE LOG, not Application Insights, so it works even when
// emit-metric is being dropped (missing metrics:true on the diagnostic). If APIM
// Analytics shows data, this table has data. What it CANNOT give is token counts -
// those exist only as App Insights custom metrics.
//
// STREAMING CAVEAT: for a streamed reply both TotalTime and ResponseSize track how
// long and how large the answer was, not gateway health. Compare BackendTime, or
// filter to non-streaming calls, before drawing latency conclusions.
//
// If a column name is rejected, the schema varies slightly by APIM version - run
//     ApiManagementGatewayLogs | getschema
// and adjust. TotalTime / BackendTime / RequestSize / ResponseSize are the usual names.
ApiManagementGatewayLogs
| where TimeGenerated > ago(24h)
| project
    TimeGenerated,
    Subscription = tostring(ApimSubscriptionId),
    Operation    = OperationId,
    Status       = ResponseCode,
    TotalMs      = TotalTime,
    BackendMs    = BackendTime,
    GatewayMs    = TotalTime - BackendTime,
    RequestBytes = RequestSize,
    ResponseBytes = ResponseSize
| order by TimeGenerated desc

// Rolled up per developer, for volume and payload trends:
//
// ApiManagementGatewayLogs
// | where TimeGenerated > ago(24h) and ResponseCode < 400
// | summarize
//     Calls        = count(),
//     p95_total    = percentile(TotalTime, 95),
//     p95_backend  = percentile(BackendTime, 95),
//     ReqMB        = round(sum(RequestSize)  / 1048576.0, 2),
//     RespMB       = round(sum(ResponseSize) / 1048576.0, 2)
//   by bin(TimeGenerated, 1h), Subscription = tostring(ApimSubscriptionId)
// | order by TimeGenerated asc
